      {
        "id": "tb-jk-to-tprime",
        "moduleId": "jk-as-source",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "JK 转 T'",
        "markdown": "T' 触发器每个时钟都翻转，特性方程为 $Q^{n+1}=\\overline{Q^n}$。把它改写成与 JK 方程一致的形式：\n\n$$Q^{n+1}=\\overline{Q^n}=1\\cdot\\overline{Q^n}+\\overline{1}\\cdot Q^n$$\n\n与 $Q^{n+1}=J\\overline{Q^n}+\\overline{K}Q^n$ 比较，得 $J=K=1$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
