      {
        "id": "model-jk-connection-table",
        "moduleId": "jk-as-source",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "JK 源转换结果汇总",
        "markdown": "把上面四种目标触发器的结果汇总，便于连线时直接查表：\n\n| 目标触发器 | 特性方程 | JK 输入端连接 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| RS | $Q^{n+1}=S+\\overline{R}Q^n$ | $J=S,\\ K=R$，且 $RS=0$ |\n| D | $Q^{n+1}=D$ | $J=D,\\ K=\\overline{D}$ |\n| T | $Q^{n+1}=T\\oplus Q^n$ | $J=K=T$ |\n| T' | $Q^{n+1}=\\overline{Q^n}$ | $J=K=1$ |\n\n共同点：JK 方程中 $\\overline{Q^n}$ 项的系数是 $J$，$Q^n$ 项的系数是 $\\overline{K}$，所以比较时先对齐这两项再读系数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-jk-to-rs-d",
            "tb-jk-to-t",
            "tb-jk-to-tprime"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
