      {
        "id": "tb-d-to-rs",
        "moduleId": "d-as-source",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "D 转 RS",
        "markdown": "RS 触发器的特性方程为 $Q^{n+1}=S+\\overline{R}Q^n$，约束为 $RS=0$。与 $Q^{n+1}=D$ 比较，得\n\n$$D=S+\\overline{R}Q^n$$\n\n即 D 端接一个实现 $S+\\overline{R}Q^n$ 的组合逻辑，并用约束 $RS=0$ 限制输入组合。",
        "provenance": {
